_I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\in V\">\\(X_\\bullet,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,I,\\leq_I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2AdaptedProcess}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb2AdaptedProcess}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ddd3fe2bb0aacd1e\" href=\"?note=ddd3fe2bb0aacd1e\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-prob2-adapted-process.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-prob2-adapted-process.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d139c8e88761c759\" href=\"?note=d139c8e88761c759\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>, and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Martingale}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Martingale}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}martingale} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Martingale}_S(X_\\bullet,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,I,\\leq_I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(I,\\leq_I)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathbb P(\\Omega)=1\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb2AdaptedProcess}_S(X_\\bullet,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\langle I,